     }
    },
    "content": [
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "RVH or cor pulmonale, pulm Emb, ischemic Hdz, rheumatic Hdz, congenital Hdz (ex, ASD), myocarditis, cardiomyopathy, Lenègre-Lev dz (degen fibrosis of the conducting system)"
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
